        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo byonabyona nga biwoire, Abaisiraeli boonaboona abaaligho baaja mu bibuga bya Buyudaaya, baamenhamenha empango edh'amabaale, baasimulagho ebifaananie eby'omusambwa omukazi Ashera n'ebifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, ni alutaari. Baaja baakola batyo mu biketezo ebindi byonabyona ebya Yuda, n'ebya Benjamini, n'ebya Efuraimu, n'ebya Manasse, okutuusa lwe baabizikiriza byonabyona. Agho abantu boonaboona bairayo mu bibuga byaibwe, buli muntu mu kibandha kye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Hezekia yaataagho bakabona n'Abalevi mu bikunsu bikunsu, nga bagheereza mu ngobo ng'omulimo gwa buli muntu bwe gwali okughangayo ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa n'ebigheebwayo olw'okutabagana, okwo nga kw'otaire okugheerezanga Musengwa Katonda, n'okumwebazanga, n'okumusaakanga mu isinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kub 28:1—29:39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kyabazinga yaatoola ku bintu ebibye ku bubwe, yaaghaayo ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa, ebya buli nkyo n'ebya buli igulo, n'eby'oku Sabbato, n'eby'oku mbaga ey'Ekibinuko eky'Okuboneka kw'Omwezi, n'eby'oku mbaga edh'ebibinuko ebindi ebyalagirwa, nga bwe kyaghandiikibwa mu Mateeka ga Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
